Sounds like an alignment problem (I believe the card has a neutral
alignment).  I have never used the card (prefer cash), but if it
is like other artifacts you should be able to use the card after
you have endured the initial blast.

CHANGING ALIGNMENT

Two ways I can think of:

(1) Obtain a helm of opposite alignment (polypiling, wishing).  I don't
    if the alignment the helmet gives is in relation to your present
    alignment, or is a property of the helmet itself.  If it's the former,
    you may not be able to reach your desired alignment, if s the latter
    you might have to go through many helmets until you find one of the
    alignment you need.

(2) Pray at an non-aligned altar.  I don't practice this too often,
    but I recall that if you are successful, you start at the beginning
    with your god, and will have to sacrafice all over again to build
    a good relationship with your new god.

Be careful of using method (1) though, if you forget to take off the
helmet while at altars of your original god, you could convert the
altar, priest (if around), and anger your god to boot.

